message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "nGibbs"
abstract: >
  Neural network emulators of MELTS, HeFESTo, and other free energy solvers
  for silicate multi-component systems. Provides fast, differentiable
  approximations of thermodynamic phase equilibria for use in geodynamic
  and petrological modelling workflows.
